		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://towers.net/2018/09/17/watch-this-east-austin-office-building-rust-before-your-eyes/</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[It would be pretty hilarious if someone designed a multi-million dollar building without ever thinking about what the weather might do to it, but that’s thankfully not the case for the five-story office project by Endeavor Real Estate Group at 901 East Sixth Street. No, this structure’s steel exterior, designed by Delineate Studio, is intended...]]></description>
		
		
		
